---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title={`About — ${site.name}`} description={`A small introduction to ${site.name}, and to the writing gathered here.`}>
  <main id="main-content" class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">About / a note</p>
      <h1>A place for words<br /><em>to arrive quietly.</em></h1>
      <p class="about-lede">{site.shortBio} This is not much of a biography; it is more like a shelf—some things I have written, noticed, kept, and returned to.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-split">
      <div class="section-label">01 / Why this place exists</div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>I wanted somewhere words could remain without needing to become announcements. A poem can be unfinished. A fragment can stay small. A thought can take its time.</p>
        <p>The site is built around that pace: pages for writing, notes for what is still unfolding, and a sketchbook for the visual things that belong beside the words.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-split">
      <div class="section-label">02 / A few ways of looking</div>
      <div class="principles">
        <article><span>01</span><h2>Leave room.</h2><p>A sentence does not always need to explain itself. Sometimes the space around it is part of the meaning.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h2>Look closely.</h2><p>Small details carry their own weather: a gesture, a room at dusk, the sound of something almost remembered.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h2>Read twice.</h2><p>The pieces I like most are the ones that change a little when you return to them.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-focus">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / Things I return to</p>
      <div class="focus-grid">
        <span>Poetry</span><span>Prose</span><span>Fragments</span><span>Memory</span><span>Images</span><span>Silence</span><span>Places</span><span>Notes</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-contact">
      <p class="eyebrow">04 / Elsewhere</p>
      <h2>Take a page with you.</h2>
      <p>Everything here is meant to be read slowly. The sketchbook is open, and the writing keeps arriving.</p>
      <a href={site.github} class="contact-link" rel="noreferrer">Find me elsewhere ↗</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.about-page { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 150px clamp(20px,5vw,48px) 100px; }
.eyebrow, .section-label { color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.about-hero { max-width: 940px; padding: 80px 0 130px; }
.about-hero h1 { margin: 18px 0 30px; font: 400 clamp(64px,11vw,150px)/.84 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
.about-hero h1 em { color: var(--earth); }
.about-lede { max-width: 58ch; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: clamp(19px,2vw,24px); line-height: 1.55; }
.about-split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 40px; padding: 40px 0 100px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
.about-copy { max-width: 68ch; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.72; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.about-copy p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.principles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.principles article { padding-top: 8px; }
.principles span { color: var(--earth); font-size: 11px; }
.principles h2 { margin: 18px 0 10px; font: 400 34px/.95 var(--display); }
.principles p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }
.about-focus { padding: 40px 0 100px; }
.focus-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); margin-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
.focus-grid span { padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; }
.about-contact { padding: 90px 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--hairline); text-align: center; }
.about-contact h2 { margin: 12px 0; font: 400 clamp(52px,8vw,96px)/.9 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.035em; }
.about-contact p { color: var(--ink-soft); }
.contact-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 6px; font-size: 18px; }
@media (max-width:800px) { .about-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; } .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .focus-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } }
</style>
